{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04726","headline":"三月三日诏宴定昆池宫庄赋得筵字 · 张说","name":"三月三日诏宴定昆池宫庄赋得筵字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤皇楼下对天泉，鹦鹉洲中匝管弦。\n旧识平阳佳丽地，今逢上巳盛明年。\n舟将水动千寻日，幕共林横两岸烟。\n不降玉人观禊饮，谁令醉舞拂宾筵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04726.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04726","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}